+# from) whatever the block above resolved, so a stale plain-spec-casc-tok
+# knob file can never silently leak into this variant's own alpha. Same
+# -inf-not-0.0 fallback as every spec-casc-tok-family patch in this repo
+# (see the module comment above spec-casc-tok's own alpha file for why).
